WEBVTT

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:12.510
...It feels like it was only yesterday...

00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:14.880
We were but ordinary girls

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:17.640
who could only long to be princesses.

00:00:18.090 --> 00:00:19.640
...Beautiful castles...

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:22.070
...Lovely dresses...

00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:23.770
...Charming princes...

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:29.440
We thought they were only a distant dream.

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:31.940
...But one day...

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:34.950
...After one fateful encounter...

00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:41.300
A spell was cast on us.

00:00:42.940 --> 00:00:46.370
A wonderful, wonderful spell.

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:07.540
This spell isn't just for us, though!

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:12.270
Everyone in the audience can be
a Prince Charming or a Cinderella!

00:02:33.190 --> 00:02:34.320
Uzuki!

00:02:35.510 --> 00:02:37.400
Thanks for coming!

00:02:37.930 --> 00:02:41.320
Was that photo from the concert?

00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:42.660
Yeah.

00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:45.830
I'm hoping that someday
I can get on stage too.

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:47.380
Me too.

00:02:47.380 --> 00:02:50.890
You were so close to passing that
Cinderella Audition the other day.

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:57.030
I've had a lot of other auditions since then,
but I haven't had any luck.

00:02:58.670 --> 00:03:01.340
But you're definitely trying
harder than anyone I know.

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:05.140
The other girls from your year
all quit, one after another.

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:08.470
All right!

00:03:08.470 --> 00:03:12.250
I'll just have to try even harder!

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:13.480
...Ow...

00:03:13.480 --> 00:03:14.480
Whoa, whoa.

00:03:14.950 --> 00:03:17.970
That's all well and good,
but don't go overboard.

00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:21.010
Sorry.

00:03:29.510 --> 00:03:30.640
Who's that?

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:31.870
Do you know him?

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:33.390
...N-No...

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:37.040
E-Excuse me.

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:39.710
If you're looking for someone, reception is just outside.

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:42.340
...No, I...

00:03:43.170 --> 00:03:45.680
Three, two,

00:03:46.060 --> 00:03:48.930
...three, four...

00:03:48.930 --> 00:03:50.930
...One, two...

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:12.450
...M-Ma...

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:15.330
Mama!

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:18.250
Are you Shimamura Uzuki?

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:29.890
346 Productions?

00:04:29.890 --> 00:04:34.020
Producer, Cinderella Project?

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:36.920
P-Producer?!

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:38.150
Yes.

00:04:38.150 --> 00:04:43.250
I believe you participated
in the Cinderella Audition.

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:45.570
The project has room
for three more idols.

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:50.280
You mean... you want me to join?

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:51.040
Yes.

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:57.770
...So that means...
I can debut as an idol?

00:04:57.770 --> 00:04:58.640
Yes.

00:05:01.850 --> 00:05:02.920
...My...

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:05.340
Debut?!

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:10.350
I'm... finally going to be an idol!

00:05:11.360 --> 00:05:14.010
Will you accept our offer?

00:05:14.010 --> 00:05:15.100
Yes!

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:17.250
Of course!

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:20.230
I'm Shimamura Uzuki,
and I'll do my best!

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:24.730
Yeah! Yeah!

00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:26.360
That's right, Mama!

00:05:26.670 --> 00:05:29.650
I'm going to debut as an idol!

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:33.260
Yeah! I'll be home in a bit!

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:34.120
Bye!

00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:37.350
Debut!

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:44.740
...A flower shop...

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:46.940
Good evening!

00:05:48.970 --> 00:05:50.670
Welcome.

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:53.760
Wow! What should I get?

00:05:56.220 --> 00:05:57.540
They're beautiful!

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:01.770
...Ones, tens, hundreds...

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:06.040
...Ones, tens, hundreds...

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:14.600
...M-Maybe something a little smaller...

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:18.160
Oh, something like this!

00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:21.190
Should I go with roses?

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:24.030
Oh, but these are beautiful too!

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:25.760
...But...

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:28.510
...Oh, but...

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:33.510
Are you looking for anything in particular?

00:06:35.430 --> 00:06:38.220
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:06:38.220 --> 00:06:40.440
I just can't decide.

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:44.350
Is it a present for someone?

00:06:44.350 --> 00:06:45.750
Yes!

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:46.870
...Well...

00:06:46.870 --> 00:06:48.990
I guess it's more of a present for myself.

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:53.740
Today is a very important day for me.

00:06:55.340 --> 00:06:57.910
How about these, then?

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:00.150
They're anemones.

00:07:00.150 --> 00:07:02.720
...They represent, um...

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:04.630
hopes and dreams.

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:08.880
...Hopes and dreams...

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:11.690
I thought it might be
what you were looking for.

00:07:14.900 --> 00:07:16.990
Thank you very much.

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:21.230
Not at all! Thank you so much!

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:24.730
I'll do my best!

00:07:29.620 --> 00:07:32.310
Thanks again, Rin!

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:34.510
I'll take over from here.

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:38.490
...Um...

00:07:39.070 --> 00:07:44.000
"We will be founding a new division for idols
and act as their producers in all areas"!

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:45.560
Wow!

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:48.570
And I'm going to be part of it?

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:49.340
Yes.

00:07:49.340 --> 00:07:53.790
Have any other idols joined yet?

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:55.420
Oh, no.

00:07:55.420 --> 00:07:58.280
You are the first to be
selected in this repeat audition.

00:07:58.280 --> 00:08:00.100
Oh, really?

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:07.370
You will officially be a part of our agency
after the other two have been selected.

00:08:07.370 --> 00:08:12.890
I'm sorry, but you'll
have to wait until then.

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:16.180
Oh, really?

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:17.640
Yes.

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:21.490
Until then, please continue
attending your art school.

00:08:23.070 --> 00:08:27.000
All right. I'll do my best!

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:30.200
Do you have any other questions?

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:32.920
...Um...

00:08:35.640 --> 00:08:37.020
Oh, yes!

00:08:37.020 --> 00:08:39.900
When do I get to release my first single?

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:41.760
That is currently under consideration.

00:08:41.760 --> 00:08:43.300
I see!

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:48.260
Um, when will I be on TV?

00:08:48.260 --> 00:08:50.110
That is currently under consideration.

00:08:50.110 --> 00:08:52.590
I see!

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:56.030
Um, will I have a concert?

00:08:56.030 --> 00:08:57.800
That is also under consideration.

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:01.090
...I-I see...

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:04.590
...And, um...

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:06.040
...Um...

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:13.590
And... why me?

00:09:14.710 --> 00:09:16.800
What do you mean?

00:09:16.800 --> 00:09:18.280
...Well...

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:22.950
I failed this audition a while back.

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:28.190
Is there a reason why you chose me now?

00:09:30.690 --> 00:09:31.830
Your smile.

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:35.880
My smile?

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:36.620
Yes.

00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:39.700
Is it an insufficient reason?

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:41.270
...No...

00:09:42.530 --> 00:09:43.600
Not at all!

00:09:44.860 --> 00:09:47.510
If there's one thing
I'm proud of, it's my smile!

00:09:47.510 --> 00:09:48.460
Yay!

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:53.210
Thank you very much!

00:09:57.620 --> 00:09:58.840
...Two others...

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:01.090
I wonder what they'll be like!

00:10:02.850 --> 00:10:05.060
E-Excuse me! You there!

00:10:10.560 --> 00:10:13.370
Would you mind telling us what you did?

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:15.610
What? I didn't do anything.

00:10:15.610 --> 00:10:17.210
...You can't tell me you didn't—

00:10:18.310 --> 00:10:19.810
What happened?

00:10:19.810 --> 00:10:20.740
Beats me.

00:10:20.740 --> 00:10:22.740
Did she do something to that kid?

00:10:20.740 --> 00:10:22.740
I told you I didn't do anything.

00:10:22.270 --> 00:10:24.580
Why is he crying, then?

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:25.630
Excuse me.

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:28.850
Could you come with me to the station?

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:29.770
...What?! Why—

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:30.670
Excuse me.

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:35.250
Would you mind listening
to her side of the story?

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:38.010
Wh-Who are you?!

00:10:38.980 --> 00:10:39.900
Huh?

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:41.890
The screw fell out of your toy?

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:45.400
I didn't want anyone to step on it,

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:47.890
so I asked her to help.

00:10:48.240 --> 00:10:51.290
I'm... I'm so sorry!
I jumped to conclusions!

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:52.410
No, it's fine.

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:56.020
I'm sorry about that.

00:10:56.530 --> 00:10:59.740
It seems I made things worse.

00:11:00.570 --> 00:11:01.780
It's fine.

00:11:01.780 --> 00:11:04.810
Sorry to take up your time.

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:06.280
...Um...

00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:09.260
I work for a talent agency.

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:12.440
Are you interested in being an idol?

00:11:15.410 --> 00:11:16.250
No.

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:20.320
So you're just a scout?

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:23.050
What, you got involved
so you could guilt me into it?

00:11:23.710 --> 00:11:25.460
...No, I didn't—

00:11:25.460 --> 00:11:30.140
Sorry, but idols don't
interest me in the slightest.

00:11:34.350 --> 00:11:35.360
Oh! Thanks for coming by!

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:38.540
What am I doing today?

00:11:39.570 --> 00:11:41.840
Keep practicing, please.

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:44.280
Practice? Okay! I'll do my best!

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:49.080
I want to get better at dancing
before I meet the others!

00:11:50.300 --> 00:11:51.440
Please continue.

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:52.310
Will do!

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:01.530
...Hey...

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:03.050
What are you doing here?

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:06.640
I told you that I wasn't interested.

00:12:08.050 --> 00:12:12.460
Would you at least take my card?

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:20.500
What was that?

00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:22.190
Seriously.

00:12:22.190 --> 00:12:23.400
What's up with him?

00:12:23.400 --> 00:12:24.150
It's him again.

00:12:24.150 --> 00:12:24.930
...Yeah...

00:12:30.490 --> 00:12:32.660
I'm not interested,
and I'm not changing my mind.

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:36.170
I don't care for being an idol.

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:42.350
How many new members
will we get this year?

00:12:42.350 --> 00:12:43.030
I wonder!

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:45.540
Wow, we're gonna have underclassmen!

00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:46.880
Can't let them down!

00:12:47.170 --> 00:12:48.050
Oh!

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:49.510
Thanks for coming by!

00:12:50.640 --> 00:12:52.860
What am I doing today?

00:12:54.260 --> 00:12:55.860
Keep practicing, please.

00:12:55.860 --> 00:12:58.270
Practice? Okay! I'll do my best!

00:12:58.850 --> 00:13:02.570
I'm starting to get the hang of
moves I wasn't very good at!

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:16.310
Rin!

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:19.180
Decide on a club yet?

00:13:19.180 --> 00:13:20.920
No, not yet.

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:22.910
Join the wind ensemble with me!

00:13:22.910 --> 00:13:24.580
You're good at music, right?

00:13:26.670 --> 00:13:28.300
Hey, you guys hear?!

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:28.690
Huh?

00:13:28.690 --> 00:13:30.050
About the pervert!

00:13:30.050 --> 00:13:32.280
They say there's a pervert
on the loose around here!

00:13:32.280 --> 00:13:33.210
You serious?

00:13:33.210 --> 00:13:35.760
Yeah, and they say
he's got this look in his eyes!

00:13:35.760 --> 00:13:37.810
Seriously?

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:42.610
What's wrong, Rin?

00:13:42.610 --> 00:13:43.550
Oh.

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:44.610
...Um...

00:13:47.910 --> 00:13:51.240
You might want to stop doing this.

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:53.870
They're calling you a pervert.

00:13:55.170 --> 00:13:58.280
Will you consider our offer?

00:14:01.850 --> 00:14:04.040
Would you at least take my card?

00:14:04.040 --> 00:14:05.050
Hey, you!

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:07.630
Again?!

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:09.910
Could you come with us for a minute?

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:11.760
Is something the matter, officer?

00:14:11.760 --> 00:14:14.330
What were you doing to her?

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:17.310
We've received reports
...about a pervert in this area—

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:15.670
...U-Um...

00:14:18.910 --> 00:14:21.100
Wait, it's a misunderstanding!

00:14:21.100 --> 00:14:23.110
346 Productions Talent Agency
Producer, Cinderella Project

00:14:26.030 --> 00:14:27.720
I'm very sorry.

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:29.280
...Look...

00:14:29.280 --> 00:14:33.530
What about me is so great
that you want me to be an idol?

00:14:35.280 --> 00:14:36.770
Your smile.

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:37.830
Huh?!

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:43.040
Have I ever smiled in front of you?

00:14:43.870 --> 00:14:46.050
No, not yet.

00:14:47.670 --> 00:14:50.590
So you were just making that up?

00:14:55.170 --> 00:14:56.630
Whatever.

00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:57.890
...C-Could I ask—

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:06.940
Do you enjoy your current life?

00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:10.190
Huh?

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:16.700
What do you mean?

00:15:17.240 --> 00:15:20.310
And what's that got
to do with you, anyway?

00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:23.830
I... don't know.

00:15:24.490 --> 00:15:28.800
I was simply curious if you had
...something you can devote yourself to—

00:15:29.670 --> 00:15:36.010
something that shakes you
to your soul—in your life.

00:15:33.260 --> 00:15:35.260
Ryuuguu
Komachi

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:39.910
That's none of your business.

00:15:46.390 --> 00:15:49.570
Oh! Check this out, Producer!

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:55.710
What do you think?

00:15:57.090 --> 00:15:58.620
Very well done.

00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:01.410
So what am I doing today?

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:02.790
...Keep practicing—

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:04.420
Huh?

00:16:04.750 --> 00:16:06.900
...R-Right...

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:10.630
Okay!

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:13.130
I'll practice my hardest!

00:16:19.340 --> 00:16:21.360
I'm sorry.

00:16:22.480 --> 00:16:25.080
All I've done is ask you
to wait and practice.

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:29.100
It's okay! I like practicing!

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:34.760
...Um...

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:37.060
...So the other two are still...

00:16:37.060 --> 00:16:38.010
Yes.

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:39.620
...I see...

00:16:43.830 --> 00:16:46.340
I'm negotiating with one of them now.

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:51.660
I intend to meet with her again today.

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:55.100
...Um...

00:16:55.100 --> 00:16:56.630
You mean right now?

00:16:58.060 --> 00:16:58.840
Yes.

00:17:01.010 --> 00:17:04.140
Um, can I go with you?

00:17:08.120 --> 00:17:08.900
Wait,

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:11.520
...this flower shop...

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:13.580
What about it?

00:17:13.580 --> 00:17:15.630
See you later.

00:17:17.020 --> 00:17:18.660
So it's you!

00:17:28.930 --> 00:17:30.630
What a cutie!

00:17:30.630 --> 00:17:32.480
Oh... yeah.

00:17:34.670 --> 00:17:37.890
Um... May I ask the name?

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:39.510
Oh.

00:17:40.180 --> 00:17:41.260
Hanako.

00:17:41.260 --> 00:17:43.380
Hanako?

00:17:43.380 --> 00:17:46.090
My name is Shimamura Uzuki.

00:17:47.060 --> 00:17:51.150
Thank you so much for choosing
my flowers the other day,

00:17:51.150 --> 00:17:52.060
Hanako!

00:17:52.060 --> 00:17:52.900
Huh?!

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:55.540
...Hanako is the dog's name...

00:17:57.850 --> 00:18:00.210
I-I'm so sorry!

00:18:09.510 --> 00:18:10.830
Rin.

00:18:11.710 --> 00:18:13.580
Shibuya Rin.

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:15.130
That's my name.

00:18:16.970 --> 00:18:18.210
Okay!

00:18:18.210 --> 00:18:20.420
Nice to meet you, Shibuya!

00:18:21.130 --> 00:18:22.420
Rin's fine.

00:18:23.810 --> 00:18:25.360
Okay!

00:18:25.360 --> 00:18:27.140
Nice to meet you, Rin!

00:18:27.910 --> 00:18:30.700
...Nice to meet you, um...

00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:32.180
Uzuki!

00:18:33.050 --> 00:18:34.150
Uzuki.

00:18:37.140 --> 00:18:40.270
...Um... So, Rin...

00:18:40.270 --> 00:18:40.910
What?

00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:44.780
Let's do our best as idols!

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:47.410
Huh?

00:18:48.010 --> 00:18:48.410
Huh?

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:51.620
...Oh...

00:18:51.620 --> 00:18:56.670
Actually, I'm not interested in being an idol.

00:18:58.890 --> 00:19:01.880
I keep telling him that,
...but he won't listen...

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:03.670
Huh?

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:07.910
Huh?!

00:19:11.530 --> 00:19:12.610
Come on!

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:13.910
Wait up!

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:15.650
Over here!

00:19:15.650 --> 00:19:17.530
Wait for me!

00:19:17.530 --> 00:19:18.350
There!

00:19:19.100 --> 00:19:20.190
Catch this!

00:19:20.190 --> 00:19:22.590
Shoot, I missed!

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:23.570
What's with him?

00:19:23.570 --> 00:19:25.150
Huh?

00:19:25.150 --> 00:19:26.570
...No, I mean...

00:19:26.570 --> 00:19:29.200
Isn't he weird? Him.

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:30.080
Huh?

00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:33.410
You mean Producer?

00:19:33.410 --> 00:19:34.220
Yeah.

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:38.680
He comes by every day
and asks me if I want to be an idol.

00:19:38.680 --> 00:19:39.850
And that's it.

00:19:39.540 --> 00:19:41.230
Mommy, is he a bad man?

00:19:40.770 --> 00:19:42.980
People think he's some kind of pervert.

00:19:41.230 --> 00:19:43.810
No, that's rude! Now apologize!

00:19:45.480 --> 00:19:49.290
And the only reason he gives
...for scouting me is "my smile".

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:50.260
Huh?!

00:19:50.260 --> 00:19:50.930
Huh?

00:19:51.720 --> 00:19:55.260
...H-He told me the same thing...

00:19:55.260 --> 00:19:56.110
Huh?

00:19:57.760 --> 00:20:01.820
But I'm pretty sure
in your case it's the truth.

00:20:01.820 --> 00:20:04.250
Y-You really think so?

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:05.080
Yeah.

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:09.850
Well, that's fine!

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:15.370
Producer might make
my dream come true after all!

00:20:16.230 --> 00:20:17.640
Your dream?

00:20:17.640 --> 00:20:19.550
Being an idol?

00:20:19.550 --> 00:20:20.370
Yeah!

00:20:25.530 --> 00:20:26.710
...Hey...

00:20:27.520 --> 00:20:30.490
Why do you want to be an idol?

00:20:30.490 --> 00:20:33.390
Huh? Why?

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:35.710
Well, I mean,

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:40.710
I'd get to wear pretty clothes,
...stand on stage in the spotlight...

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:43.400
It's like being a princess!

00:20:44.030 --> 00:20:47.410
I want to be like her!

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:54.800
...Um...

00:20:54.800 --> 00:21:02.420
To tell you the truth,
I'm not sure what exactly idols do.

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:07.180
But it's my dream.

00:21:10.260 --> 00:21:15.990
I've been attending an art school, learning,
and practicing with the other girls there.

00:21:15.990 --> 00:21:18.690
And I've been waiting.

00:21:19.120 --> 00:21:20.940
To be an idol.

00:21:20.940 --> 00:21:26.040
Believing that, one day,
I'd be able to sparkle too.

00:21:26.950 --> 00:21:28.950
Hoping that it was true.

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:31.070
I've always wanted it to be.

00:21:32.690 --> 00:21:37.460
And then Producer reached out to me.

00:21:37.460 --> 00:21:38.730
He did?

00:21:45.640 --> 00:21:49.270
Producer found me.

00:21:51.600 --> 00:21:57.350
So my dreams will
come true! I just know it!

00:21:57.970 --> 00:22:00.480
And I'm overjoyed!

00:22:09.480 --> 00:22:11.340
Hanako! Come back!

00:22:20.480 --> 00:22:22.280
Thanks.

00:22:26.540 --> 00:22:27.890
...If...

00:22:28.830 --> 00:22:32.300
If you're looking for something
...you can devote yourself to...

00:22:33.440 --> 00:22:36.270
Why not try taking the first step?

00:22:37.070 --> 00:22:42.390
I'm certain that you'll find
a whole new world waiting for you.

00:23:19.300 --> 00:23:21.530
Shibuya Rin. 15 years old.

00:23:21.530 --> 00:23:23.560
I hope we can make this thing happen.

00:23:24.400 --> 00:23:26.000
Rin!

00:23:26.000 --> 00:23:28.350
Let's make it happen, Uzuki.

00:23:28.350 --> 00:23:30.070
Yeah! Let's do it!

00:23:31.900 --> 00:23:34.790
So, you're my producer?

00:23:37.750 --> 00:23:39.950
Yes. Thank you for coming.

00:23:43.350 --> 00:23:44.710
Thank you very much.

00:23:45.830 --> 00:23:49.000
Next, will number 4 please stand?

00:23:49.870 --> 00:23:50.460
Here!

00:23:52.340 --> 00:23:54.940
Number 4, Honda Mio!

00:23:54.940 --> 00:23:56.630
Thank you for this opportunity!
